.claude/
**/.claude/
node_modules/
# The validation corpus, which `npm run corpus:fetch` checks out at the commit corpus.lock.json pins.
/corpus/
# The package build, at the root only: corpus-snapshot/ commits reports for the corpus's dist/ sites.
/dist/
*.tgz
# The accuracy scoring harness writes here by default (npm run score).
/scores/
# The cost benchmark writes here by default (npm run benchmark).
/benchmarks/
